 Republic\" to verify rumors that Bio-Organic Weapons (BOWs) are being used in the country's civil war, which the U.S. and Russia are making preparations to jointly intervene in. Right after his infiltration, the U.S. government orders him to leave immediately. Determined to uncover the truth, Leon ignores the order and enters the battlefield to end the chain of tragedies caused by the BOWs.","tagline":"When terror crawls, evil is unleashed."},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"バイオハザード ダムネーション","overview":"アメリカ合衆国大統領直属のエージェントのレオンは、東スラブ共和国の内戦で、生物兵器「B.O.W.」が使用されているという情報を受けて、一人で潜入を試みる。しかし、ほどなく東スラブ共和国から手を引くことが決定し、同国からの撤退命令が下る。だがレオンは「B.O.W.」の脅威によりこれ以上犠牲者を出さないため、撤退せずに単独で同国内での戦闘を継続する。","tagline":"戦場に放たれた邪悪━━ B.O.W.（生物兵器）実戦投入。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cu3WaOhHgvvyvJ0KN42YrgZpHrX.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xbjOkrAaT4CAIrNJ38oQSBomHvg.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":133121,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zkHSURVCrt7rpvDDgUXO75CV1v4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zkHSURVCrt7rpvDDgUXO75CV1v4.jpg","language":"en","width":1280,"height":1920},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zkHSURVCrt7rpvDDgUXO75CV1v4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zkHSURVCrt7rpvDDgUXO75CV1v4.jpg","language":"en","width":1280,"height":1920},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e9qN1vhumyvnYQfqlhsyLyquzZS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e9qN1vhumyvnYQfqlhsyLyquzZS.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yhokCOGRDEaldBUkqNOYVbRvdga.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yhokCOGRDEaldBUkqNOY